{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkxPu2PL6UF9SfoWBHge","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm going with מיטב, the \"עוקב מדד מניות\" track. Its 3-year return is 25.86%, and I know the name, it's a big investment house. I'm fairly sure, maybe more than I should be. What decided it is that it had about the highest 3-year number on the whole list (except one other) and the fee looked the same as everyone else's.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **What I looked at, in order:**\n  - **First screen:** the big heading \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\". The \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\" button was already lit, so this was the right place.\n  - **Table:** I went down it by company: הראל, מור, אנליסט, מיטב, אלטשולר שחם, הפניקס, ילין לפידות, מגדל, כלל, מנורה, אינפיניטי, איילון.\n  - **The column I actually used:** the big returns, \"3 שנים\". Most rows are around 4–13%. A few jump out: אנליסט \"עוקב מדדים - גמיש\" 26.39%, מיטב \"עוקב מדד מניות\" 25.86%, הראל \"מניות\" 24.04%.\n  - **S&P 500 tracks:** they're all about 13–14% everywhere.\n  - **Fees:** all of them are \"0.5%–0.7% מהחיסכון\", which all looks the same to me. Basically nothing.\n  - **Bottom of the page:** I stopped at the end of the list.\n- **What I skipped:**\n  - The orange box at the top (\"נתוני הרשות לא עודכנו...\").\n  - The row of category buttons and the search box.\n  - The grey text at the bottom.\n  - The fund numbers like 15283 and the \"נכסים\" column.\n  - The little arrows on each row. I never tapped one.\n- **Where I hesitated:**\n  - **Too many options:** there are 143 tracks and many have the same name at every company. Around the 4th–5th screen I got bored and almost closed it.\n  - **\"פחות מ־3 שנים\":** a lot of rows have this instead of a number, so I can't compare those.\n  - **What 25.86% means:** I'm not sure if it's per year or for the whole 3 years.\n  - **אנליסט vs. מיטב:** אנליסט's 26.39% was higher, but \"גמיש\" sounded vague and I'm less sure about that name.\n- **What I didn't get:**\n  - \"מט\"ח\" with a percent next to it, inside the colour ring.\n  - \"101%\" מניות. How do you get more than 100?\n  - \"מהפקדות\" next to \"מהחיסכון\".\n  - \"עוד לא דווח\" with the orange warning icon. It scared me off those rows.\n  - \"הלכה יהודית\" and \"הלכה איסלאמית\".\n  - \"גמיש\".\n- **What bothered me:**\n  - It's one endless list with no \"recommended\" pick.\n  - Nothing in shekels shows what the fee would cost on my 30,000.\n  - There's no button that tells me what to actually do first to open one."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8274,"cache_read_input_tokens":22150,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8274},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"98b192ae-71ac-4269-8168-8047549986af","uuid":"93d00d05-5b9d-4e66-a899-a606be35e1f2","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:22:10.847Z","request_id":"req_011CgkxPtiHabVJmgAJk89dJ"}
